Cold pressed<br>•<strong>&nbsp;Form</strong>: oil<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Use</strong>: Body, Face, and hair<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Supply Type</strong>: OBM (Original Brand Manufacturing)<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Brand Name</strong>: moroccan organica or private labeling<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Price</strong>: Ex-work<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Cultivation Type</strong>: Organic<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Main Ingredient</strong>: cumin<br>•&nbsp;<strong>FOB Price</strong>&nbsp;:Contact US</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Product available in private labeling contact us for more information</strong></p>', 'Cumin essential oil');

', 'cyperus-rotundus-oil-hair-removal', 'Moroccan Cyperus Rotundus oil hair removal', 'Discover Natural Cyperus Rotundus Oil soothes skin after hair removal, provides light hydration, and may help reduce hair regrowth with regular use. Ideal for daily natural skincare routines.
