', 'moroccan-sidr-powder-wholesale-', 'Moroccan Sidr Powder Wholesale | 100% Pure for Hair & Skin ', 'Buy 100% pure Moroccan Sidr powder for hair and skin. Natural cleanser, strengthens hair, reduces dandruff, and improves skin clarity. Wholesale & bulk available from Morocco.', 'Moroccan sidr powder, sidr powder Morocco, sidr powder for hair, sidr powder for skin, organic sidr powder wholesale, sidr powder supplier Morocco', NULL, NULL, '<p>Moroccan Sidr Powder is a natural remedy traditionally used in Moroccan medicine. Extracted from the leaves of the Sidr tree, it is known for its powerful skin-lightening and purifying properties, helping you achieve clear and radiant skin.</p><p><strong>Benefits of Sidr Powder</strong></p><ul><li><p>Lightens the skin and evens out skin tone</p></li><li><p>Reduces dark spots and pigmentation</p></li><li><p>Deeply cleanses the skin and reduces acne</p></li><li><p>Suitable for all skin types</p></li><li><p>Improves skin elasticity and appearance</p></li><li><p>Contains antibacterial properties that help treat infections</p></li><li><p>Strengthens hair, reduces dandruff, and promotes hair growth</p></li></ul><p><strong>How to Use</strong></p><p>Mix Sidr powder with rose water or honey to form a smooth paste. Apply it to the skin for 20 minutes, then rinse with warm water. For best results, use it once a week.</p><p>Sidr Powder is considered one of the timeless beauty secrets of Moroccan hammams and has been used for centuries for glowing and healthy skin.</p>', 'Moroccan Sidr Powder- Hair & Skin 100% Pure');

