INSERT INTO "ProductTranslation" ("id", "productId", "language", "name", "description", "slug", "metaTitle", "metaDesc", "keywords", "ogImage", "canonical", "details", "h1") VALUES ('1acd45ee-468c-4c80-87df-992bdac0d87a', '9410ff1b-aef4-489a-9d2c-c7fded7e8550', 'fr', 'Rosehip Oil 5L – 1.32 Gallon | 100% Pure Cold Pressed', 'Rosehip Oil is a 100% pure, cold-pressed oil extracted from Rosa Canina seeds.', 'rosehip-oil-5l-132-gallon-100-pure-cold-pressed-fr', 'Rosehip Oil 5L – 1.32 Gallon | 100% Pure Cold Pressed | Organica', 'Rosehip Oil is a 100% pure, cold-pressed oil extracted from Rosa Canina seeds. Rich in essential fatty acids, Vitamin A, and antioxidants, it is widely used in skincare formulations and professional beauty treatments. This bulk size is ideal for cosmetic manufacturing, salons, spas, and professional use.
INSERT INTO "ProductTranslation" ("id", "productId", "language", "name", "description", "slug", "metaTitle", "metaDesc", "keywords", "ogImage", "canonical", "details", "h1") VALUES ('26ca7a3b-1427-4831-9cac-0d10d668b7ec', '78a786a1-edf3-4b59-9aac-29c99877a81d', 'en', ' Blue Tansy ', 'Moroccan blue tansy essential oil', 'moroccan-blue-tansy-essential-oil', 'Blue Tansy Essential Oil Wholesale', 'Blue Tansy Essential Oil is one of the beauty community and it is filled with life-changing products from the amazing land of Morocco. Morocco has given some out of the world products one after the other in the skincare arena. ', 'blue tansy essential oil', NULL, NULL, '<p>Moroccan Blue Tansy Essential Oil is one of the beauty community and it is filled with life-changing products from the amazing land of Morocco. Morocco has given some out of the world products one after the other in the skincare arena. The mystic land has so much to offer especially when the world is going organic. Argan oil was the first essential oil that caught people’s eye for its wonderful qualities. Essential oils have numerous qualities that treat skin conditions to provide healthy and glowing skin.</p><p>They can be mixed with a product or can be used directly. Different variants of essential oils have different qualities that focus on particular skin issues. The best thing about essential oil is that they are naturally obtained and exist in the purest form thus tending to be extremely potent.</p><h1><strong>The healing essential oil: Moroccan Blue Tansy Essential Oil</strong></h1><p>One of the hidden gems from Morocco is the Moroccan Blue Tansy Essential Oil; it is also known as the Moroccan Blue Chamomile. It is viscous oil with indigo blue color. for the purpose of the color is generally so strong that it can stain a piece of clothing or even skin. The blue color is due to the presence of chamazulene, an anti-inflammatory compound. The oil is known to have anti-inflammatory and antihistaminic properties. Similarly, it has soothing and calming properties that make it essentially useful for aromatic applications. It has a beautifully fruity, subtly floral aroma.</p><p>Blue Tansy Essential Oil can be used in n number of ways to use its full potential. It is a substitute to German Chamomile or Yarrow in skincare. It is used in different dilutions to treat skin concerns.</p><p><strong>Origin of Moroccan Blue Tansy Essential Oil</strong></p><p>Incidentally, the plant from the flower of which Tansy is obtained is a native to the Mediterranean basin. The plant gradually disappeared from the region due to the excessive harvesting of wild plants. It has been reintroduced in Morocco in the past few years. Blue Tansy essential oil is considered to be a natural source of theophylline. Theophylline is a bronchial-dilator which helps a great deal in Asthma.</p><p><strong>Benefits of Moroccan Blue Tansy Essential Oil</strong></p><p>Besides asthma, Blue Tansy Essential Oil is also used as anti-allergenic, anti-inflammatory, anti-anxiety, calming, cooling sedative ingredient which can be used in combination with other oils for different skin conditions.</p><p>It is noteworthy here that natural products have proved that when it comes to beauty and health, nothing can beat the organic and natural. as a result, Morocco is certainly a land of hidden treasures which has given many such products to the health and beauty industry. But at the same time, rarity makes it prone to piracy and fraud. The buyers should be aware of this so that they actually get what they are paying for.</p><p><strong>Quick Details</strong></p><p>Min.Order Quantity: 1 Liter/Liters<br>Supply Ability: 2000 Liter/Liters per Week<br>Port: Casablanca /Tanger MED / Agadir<br>Payment Terms: L/C,T/T,Western Union,MoneyGram,PAYPAL<br><strong>Packaging &amp; Delivery</strong><br>Packaging Details :<br>40ml, 60ml, 100ml ,125ml, in PET plastic bottle with pump 250ml, 500 ml, 1Liter, 10 Liters, 20 liters, 25 liters ,33 Liters in drum with cap essential Oil can be 40ml, 60ml, 100ml ,250ml, 500 ml in amber or transparent glass bottle with cap.<br>Delivery Time: 15 days after confirmation of all details and deposit<br>Place of Origin: Morocco<br>Processing type: Cold pressed<br>Form: oil<br>Use: Body, Face, and hair<br>Supply Type: OBM (Original Brand Manufacturing)<br>Brand Name: Moroccan organica or private labeling<br>Price: Ex-work<br>Cultivation Type: Organic<br>Main Ingredient: bleu tansy<br>FOB Price: Contact US<br>Product available in private labeling contact us for more information</p>', ' Blue Tansy ');
