d calm the skin.<br><br>For Aromatherapy: Diffuse the calming scent in your space to relieve stress, promote relaxation, and enhance your mood.<br><br>For Massage: Add a few drops to a carrier oil and massage into your skin for a soothing, anti-inflammatory effect.<br><br>Embrace the natural power of Blue Tansy Essential Oil and experience its skin-calming and mind-soothing benefits. A must-have in your essential oil collection for a more relaxed, radiant you.</strong></p>', 'زيت التانسي الأزرق العطري (زيت البابونج) 5 لتر -1.32086 جالون');
