INSERT INTO "ProductTranslation" ("id", "productId", "language", "name", "description", "slug", "metaTitle", "metaDesc", "keywords", "ogImage", "canonical", "details", "h1") VALUES ('4bce7d28-cafc-4a59-91a4-ef087c7facd1', '37fde8de-7f3a-4dfd-b127-f140900566de', 'ar', 'فلفل اسود', 'The essential oil which is obtained from black pepper is known as black pepper essential oil. The oil has got all of the primary ingredients of black pepper, together with the extra advantage that it’s volatile and could be utilized in aromatherapy. The health benefits of Black Pepper Essential Oil could be related to its properties like a digestive, diaphoretic, carminative, aperient, antispasmodic, antirheumatic, antiarthritic, antibacterial, as well as antioxidant compound.
INSERT INTO "ProductTranslation" ("id", "productId", "language", "name", "description", "slug", "metaTitle", "metaDesc", "keywords", "ogImage", "canonical", "details", "h1") VALUES ('d9d3e6fb-d0aa-48e7-b73b-a04365e3fd47', '37fde8de-7f3a-4dfd-b127-f140900566de', 'fr', 'Black Pepper', 'The essential oil which is obtained from black pepper is known as black pepper essential oil. The oil has got all of the primary ingredients of black pepper, together with the extra advantage that it’s volatile and could be utilized in aromatherapy. The health benefits of Black Pepper Essential Oil could be related to its properties like a digestive, diaphoretic, carminative, aperient, antispasmodic, antirheumatic, antiarthritic, antibacterial, as well as antioxidant compound.
INSERT INTO "ProductTranslation" ("id", "productId", "language", "name", "description", "slug", "metaTitle", "metaDesc", "keywords", "ogImage", "canonical", "details", "h1") VALUES ('a48c5950-aaba-4df3-a179-ede31e6e10d9', '7981b1f3-b738-4b10-8b7d-cd8ac622a412', 'en', 'Rosemary', 'Rosemary essential oil', 'rosemary-essential-oil', 'Rosemary Essential Oil Wholesale', 'Rosemary oil is probably the most widely used essential oil because of its wide range of health advantages.', 'rosemary essential oil', NULL, NULL, '<p><em>Rosemary oil is probably the most widely used essential oil because of its wide range of health advantages. It has become progressively crucial as well as well-known through the years as more of its various health benefits have become understood, which includes its capability to encourage hair growth, enhance the mental activity, reduce respiratory problems and minimize pain. Rosemary has been thoroughly utilized since ancient times for numerous reasons. The healing powers of Rosemary oil are in part because of the fact that it is an essential oil.&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>Health Benefits of Rosemary Essential Oil</strong></h4><p><strong><em>Hair Benefits of Rosemary Oil</em></strong></p><p><em>Along with its health and skin benefits, rosemary essential oil is recognized to encourage hair growth as well as thickness. You can use it along with carrier oils like coconut, olive or almond oils for maximum benefits.</em></p><p><strong><em>Stimulates the Hair Follicles</em></strong></p><p><em>Rosemary oil stimulates the hair follicles, therefore enabling your hair to grow stronger and longer. By revitalizing cell division and dilating the blood vessels, this oil stimulates the hair follicles into producing new hair growth.</em></p><p><strong><em>Darkens Hair</em></strong></p><p><em>Besides being a stimulant for the roots and also the scalp, this oil is renowned for its hair darkening properties and therefore, is a better option than dying your hair with chemicals. In case you have hints of grey within your hair, you are able to massage it with rosemary essential oil. This can gently and softly darken your hair without the side effects of harsh chemicals.</em>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><em>Treatment of Dandruff</em></strong></p><p><em>Rosemary oil is helpful for the dry and flaky scalp and could avoid premature baldness. Regular massage with this particular oil nourishes your scalp and helps to eliminate dandruff. It may be combined with tea tree oil and basil oil to be more effective.</em></p><p><strong><em>Great Conditioner</em></strong></p><p><em>Using rosemary oil regularly makes flowing hair soft and manageable. Thus, it’s an excellent natural conditioner.</em></p><p><strong><em>Benefits of Rosemary Oil for Skin</em></strong></p><p><em>The astringent properties of rosemary essential oil allow it to be good for skincare. It includes lots of different nutrients like iron, calcium, vitamins, and antioxidants. Therefore, this oil is beneficial for all skin types and is also utilized as a component in skincare cleansers, soaps, face masks, toners, and creams.</em></p><p><strong><em>Rejuvenates Skin</em></strong></p><p><em>Massaging the skin along with rosemary essential oil rehydrates and tones your skin. It eliminates wrinkles and bags on the skin, therefore keeping it taut and healthy. Its cell regeneration properties are effective for visible skin disorders and replacing damaged tissue, therefore lowering the appearance of scars and spots.</em></p><p><strong><em>Treatment of Acne</em></strong></p><p><em>Rosemary oil has got effective disinfectant and antiseptic properties that really help to deal with acne and oily skin conditions. Massaging the face with this oil improves skin complexion by lightening dark spots as well as blemishes onto the skin.</em></p><p><strong><em>Anti-aging</em></strong></p><p><em>Being full of effective antioxidants, rosemary oil decelerates the effect of aging onto the skin. It will help in tightening sagging and loose skin, thus making it firmer and much more elastic. Moreover, it encourages biological activity and cell growth to lessen fine lines and wrinkles.</em></p><p><strong><em>Prevents Skin Infection</em></strong></p><p><em>The medicinal qualities of rosemary essential oil allow it to be good for treating long-term skin conditions like dermatitis, eczema, and psoriasis. Its anti-inflammatory properties are helpful in lessening swelling and puffiness of the skin in addition to healing burns.</em></p><p><strong><em>Reduces Saggy Skin</em></strong></p><p><em>Rosemary oil is definitely an astringent. When putting on the skin, it draws the skin cells together as if trying to shrink or compress them. This particular effect decreases loose in the skin and causes it to be stronger and much suppler.</em></p><p><strong><em>Reduces any kind of marks or scars</em></strong></p><p><em>Add rosemary oil and vitamin E to carrier oil. This mixture reduces the visibility of stretch marks, acne scars as well as scars created by cuts, scrapes, and wounds. Additionally, it decreases wrinkles and fine lines.</em></p><p><strong><em>Protect the skin from free radicals</em></strong></p><p><em>Rosemary essential oil possesses a powerful antioxidant capacity. It, therefore, defends the skin cells from damage by free radicals within our environment.</em></p><p><strong><em>Apply on insect bites</em></strong></p><p><em>When the sting of the insect bite reduces, there is a still lot of swelling left. One generally applies ice on this. However, applying some rosemary essential oil can reduce the swelling and the redness of the bite.</em></p><p><strong><em>Treat fungal skin infections</em></strong></p><p><em>Rosemary essential oil can be applied straight to fungal infections [3], like athlete’s foot and ringworm. One can utilize it undiluted ( neat ) for stronger power.</em></p><p><strong><em>For dermatitis and eczema</em></strong></p><p><em>In these conditions, the skin is irritated and itchy. Add aloe vera gel, rosemary essential oil inside a beeswax base and apply only on eczema lesions. This mixture is totally natural and relieves itching. Additionally, it can function for psoriasis.</em></p><p><strong><em>Indigestion</em></strong></p><p><em>Rosemary oil is usually utilized for indigestion, reducing flatulence, stomach cramps, constipation, and bloating. Rosemary essential oil is additionally thought to alleviate the signs of dyspepsia and it’s also a hunger stimulant. Furthermore, research has revealed the essential oil to be detoxifying for the liver, and in addition, it helps you to manage the creation and release of bile, which is a key part of the digestive process. Additionally, it stimulates blood flow and improves circulation, which could benefit the absorption of nutrients from food. Rosemary leaves are frequently included with meat dishes because it is particularly useful in digesting meat, particularly lamb, beef and pork.</em></p><p><strong><em>Mouth care</em></strong></p><p><em>Rosemary essential oil is really a disinfectant and is also frequently utilized as a mouth wash. It may also help in eliminating bad breath. By removing oral bacteria, rosemary essential oil can avoid gingivitis, cavities, plaque buildup, along with other damaging dental conditions.</em></p><p><strong><em>Boosting mental activity</em></strong></p><p><em>Rosemary essential oil is a superb brain and nerve tonic. It is usually utilized by students throughout exam times since it raises concentration helping in studying effectively. It encourages mental activity and is also an excellent treatment for depression, mental fatigue, and forgetfulness. Inhaling rosemary oil looks to lift your spirits immediately. Once your brain is exhausted, try inhaling a little rosemary oil to eliminate monotony and renew your mental energy.</em></p><p><strong><em>Stress Relief</em></strong></p><p><em>Besides the calming nature of aromatherapy and general inhalation of rosemary essential oil, it has been established to really decrease the degree of cortisol in the saliva. Cortisol is probably the main stress hormones that are produced throughout the “flight or fight” response of the body to stress. Excessive cortisol within the blood that could occur because of long-term stress can ruin the body, which includes its hormonal balance and also the effectiveness of the metabolism.</em></p><p><strong><em>Immune System Boost</em></strong></p><p><em>Antioxidants are among the most effective protective weapons we’ve within our body for overcoming infection and disease, so any food or essential oil that either adds to or stimulates the activity of antioxidants is a huge benefit to overall health. The same study which found that cortisol levels decreased after simultaneous massage and inhalation of rosemary essential oil also discovered that the scavenging free radical activity within the test subjects’ bodies also increased significantly. This means that normal use or inhalation of rosemary essential oil in aromatherapy sessions or even in other ways can increase the strength of the immune system which helps fight all the diseases related to free-radicals, which includes cancer as well as heart disease.</em></p><h3><strong><br>Quick Details</strong></h3><p><strong>Min.Order Quantity</strong>: 1 Liter/Liters</p><p><strong>Supply Ability</strong>: 2000 Liter/Liters per Week</p><p><strong>Port</strong>: Casablanca /Tanger MED / Agadir</p><p><strong>Payment Terms</strong>: L/C,T/T,Western Union,MoneyGram,PAYPAL</p><p><strong>Packaging &amp; Delivery</strong>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Packaging Details&nbsp;</strong>: 40ml, 60ml, 100ml ,125ml, in PET plastic bottle with pump 250ml, 500 ml, 1Liter, 10 Liters, 20 liters, 25 liters ,33 Liters in drum with cap essential Oil can be 40ml, 60ml, 100ml ,250ml, 500 ml in amber or trasparent glass bottle with cap.</p><p><strong>Delivery Time</strong>: 15 days after confirmation of all details and deposit</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Place of Origin</strong>: Morocco<br><strong>Processing type</strong>: Cold pressed<br><strong>Form</strong>: oil<br><strong>Use</strong>: Body, Face, and hair<br><strong>Supply Type</strong>: OBM (Original Brand Manufacturing)<br><strong>Brand Name</strong>: Moroccan organica or private labeling<br><strong>Price</strong>: Ex-work<br><strong>Cultivation Type</strong>: Organic<br><strong>Main Ingredient</strong>: Rosemary<br><strong>FOB Price</strong>:&nbsp;Contact US</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Product available in private labeling contact us for more information</strong></p>', 'Rosemary');
