armful toxins that exist internally. Additionally, it raises sweat as well as perspiration, which allows the body to rapidly eliminate toxins, excessive salt, and water. This is often helpful to all systems within the body, also it helps prevent acne along with other skin disorders which are because of toxic buildup. And also this benefits as well as cleanses the liver, also it helps reduce cholesterol levels naturally.</p><p>&nbsp;<strong><br>Quick Details</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Min.Order Quantity</strong>: 1 Liter/Liters</p><p><strong>Supply Ability</strong>: 2000 Liter/Liters per Week</p><p><strong>Port</strong>: Casablanca /Tanger MED / Agadir</p><p><strong>Payment Terms</strong>: L/C,T/T,Western Union,MoneyGram,PAYPAL</p><p><strong>Packaging &amp; Delivery</strong></p><p><strong>Packaging Details&nbsp;</strong>: 40ml, 60ml, 100ml ,125ml, in PET plastic bottle with pump 250ml, 500 ml, 1Liter, 10 Liters, 20 liters, 25 liters ,33 Liters in drum with cap essential Oil can be 40ml, 60ml, 100ml ,250ml, 500 ml in amber or transparent glass bottle with cap.</p><p><strong>Delivery Time</strong>: 15 days after confirmation of all details and deposit</p><p><strong>• Place of Origin</strong>: Morocco<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Processing type</strong>: Cold pressed<br>•<strong>&nbsp;Form</strong>: oil<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Use</strong>: Body, Face, and hair<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Supply Type</strong>: OBM (Original Brand Manufacturing)<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Brand Name</strong>: Moroccan organica or private labeling<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Price</strong>: Ex-work<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Cultivation Type</strong>: Organic<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Main Ingredient</strong>: Cypress<br>•&nbsp;<strong>FOB Price</strong>: Contact US</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Product available in private labeling contact us for more information</strong></p>', 'Cypress essential oil');
INSERT INTO "ProductTranslation" ("id", "productId", "language", "name", "description", "slug", "metaTitle", "metaDesc", "keywords", "ogImage", "canonical", "details", "h1") VALUES ('353195de-e2f7-4e72-a8d7-19ed7d7aa713', 'fb7a11f2-a148-476c-8f21-440f48d55042', 'en', 'Garlic Essential Oil', 'Pure garlic essential oil', 'garlic-essential-oil', 'Garlic Essential Oil Wholesale', 'Garlic essential oil wholesale', 'garlic essential oil', NULL, NULL, '<p>Garlic is a close relative of shallot, onion, chive, leek, and rakko and also a species of genus onion, Allium. As garlic is inherent in Central Asia, it has been vital for the Mediterranean region and condiments for Asia, Europe, and Africa.</p><p>It has antiviral, antifungal and antibacterial properties. helps to prevent heart diseases (such as atherosclerosis, high cholesterol, and high blood pressure) and cancer (such as stomach and colon cancers). It also reduces cholesterol and cardiovascular problems.</p><h3><strong>Health Benefits of&nbsp; GARLIC ESSENTIAL&nbsp; OIL</strong></h3><h4><strong>Strengthens your immune system</strong></h4><p>It is a powerhouse and increases the immunity power with its nutrients such as B2, B5, B9, B1, B3, magnesium, calcium, zinc, potassium, Vitamin C, carbohydrates, phosphorus, iron, and protein. Adding 1 drop of garlic essential oil to the diffuser and inhaling this aroma will improve the immune system and white blood cells which helps to fight against diseases.</p><h4><strong>Skin health</strong></h4><p>Garlic oil provides various skin benefits and cure infections such as ringworm, jock itch and athlete’s foot. A few drops of garlic essential oil should be added to the warm water and dipping foot on this water may get rid of itchy athlete’s foot.</p><h4><strong>Acne</strong></h4><p>This Oil&nbsp;has the ability to eliminate the blemishes. Acne fighting mask can be prepared at home with garlic oil as it has antioxidant properties.</p><h4><strong>Healthy hair</strong></h4><p><strong>Garlic oil&nbsp;</strong>helps to prevent scalp related diseases due to the presence of Vitamin B6, sulfur, Vitamin E, Vitamin B1, and Vitamin C. It prevents from breaking hair strands and makes the hair strong. If the garlic oil is massaged on the scalp and hair and left overnight then it increases the blood circulation and promotes hair growth. It makes the scalp healthy by clearing toxic substances. Garlic oil is very effective in treating dandruff. Garlic oil or garlic oil capsules should be applied to the scalp to get rid of itchy scalp.</p><h4><strong>Reduces cholesterol and checks obesity</strong></h4><p>Garlic assists in reducing cholesterol levels, blood triglycerides, and the creation of arterial plaque. It prevents obesity by removing the excess deposits of water, fat, salts and other toxic substances and controlling the fat cells pattern. The mixture of 5 drops of Garlic essential oil and 3 ml of sesame oils if massaged then it helps to discharge excess water and toxins from the body through sweating and urination and dissolves fat. This can also help to reduce inflammation caused by rheumatism and arthritis.</p><h4><strong>Cancer</strong></h4><p>It helps to increase the immune system which helps to fight against cancer. The researcher says that the risk of colorectal cancer is reduced by 30% who consume more garlic.</p><h4><strong>Heart disease</strong></h4><p>Some studies say that heart disease is prevented from garlic. Atherosclerosis and blood pressure is lowered by 5% to 8%. Garlic helps to prohibit strokes and heart attacks as it operates as a blood thinner.</p><p>&nbsp;<strong><br>Quick Details</strong></p><p><strong>Min.Order Quantity</strong>: 1 Liter/Liters</p><p><strong>Supply Ability</strong>: 2000 Liter/Liters per Week</p><p><strong>Port</strong>: Casablanca /Tanger MED / Agadir</p><p><strong>Payment Terms</strong>: L/C,T/T,Western Union,MoneyGram,PAYPAL</p><p><strong>Packaging &amp; Delivery</strong></p><p><strong>Packaging Details&nbsp;</strong>: 40ml, 60ml, 100ml ,125ml, in PET plastic bottle with pump 250ml, 500 ml, 1Liter, 10 Liters, 20 liters, 25 liters ,33 Liters in drum with cap essential Oil can be 40ml, 60ml, 100ml ,250ml, 500 ml in amber or transparent glass bottle with cap.</p><p><strong>Delivery Time</strong>: 15 days after confirmation of all details and deposit</p><p><strong>• Place of Origin</strong>: Morocco<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Processing type</strong>: Cold pressed<br>•<strong>&nbsp;Form</strong>: oil<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Use</strong>: Body, Face, and hair<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Supply Type</strong>: OBM (Original Brand Manufacturing)<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Brand Name</strong>: Moroccan organica or private labeling<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Price</strong>: Ex-work<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Cultivation Type</strong>: Organic<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Main Ingredient</strong>: GARLIC<br>•&nbsp;<strong>FOB Price</strong>: Contact us</p><p><strong>Product available in private labeling contact us for more information</strong></p>', 'Garlic Essential Oil');
