 routine.<br><br>Hydrates &amp; Nourishes<br>Rich in vitamin E and antioxidants, Moroccan Black Soap nourishes and hydrates the skin, ensuring it stays moisturized and healthy. It helps balance your skin''s moisture levels, leaving it soft, smooth, and supple.<br><br>Gentle on All Skin Types<br>This organic Moroccan Black Soap is perfect for all skin types, even sensitive skin. It’s designed to cleanse without stripping your skin of its natural oils, making it an ideal option for those with dry, acne-prone, or mature skin.<br><br>Anti-Aging Benefits<br>The high antioxidant content in Moroccan Black Soap helps fight the signs of aging by reducing fine lines, wrinkles, and dull skin. It improves skin texture, leaving you with a youthful and glowing complexion.<br><br>Detoxifies the Skin<br>Moroccan Black Soap naturally detoxifies the skin, removing impurities and excess oils while maintaining the skin’s natural balance. It helps revitalize your skin, leaving it refreshed and glowing after each use.<br><br>How to Use Moroccan Black Soap:<br>Apply a thin layer of Moroccan Black Soap to damp skin.<br><br>Leave it on for 5-10 minutes to allow the active ingredients to penetrate.<br><br>Rinse off with warm water and use a Kessa glove to exfoliate your skin in circular motions, revealing soft, smooth, and glowing skin.<br><br>Follow up with a moisturizer to lock in hydration.<br><br>Why Choose Our Moroccan Black Soap?<br>Our 100% organic Moroccan Black Soap is made with the finest ingredients sourced directly from Morocco. It’s free from harsh chemicals, preservatives, and artificial fragrances, making it a pure and gentle choice for your skincare routine. Whether you want to detoxify your skin, treat yourself to a spa experience, or simply nourish your skin, our Moroccan Black Soap is the perfect addition to your daily beauty regimen.</strong></p>', 'Moroccan Black Soap 10Kg - 2.6417Gallon');
INSERT INTO "ProductTranslation" ("id", "productId", "language", "name", "description", "slug", "metaTitle", "metaDesc", "keywords", "ogImage", "canonical", "details", "h1") VALUES ('5a305f10-a3fa-47c1-bd10-f815da9fd4df', '7f3933a7-9acc-4b6f-99fc-c81426a678d8', 'en', 'jojoba oil 100% Pure & Organic cold pressed- 5 L -1.32086 Gallon', ' Discover the versatility and natural beauty benefits of Jojoba Oil, a lightweight, nutrient-rich oil that mimics the skin''s natural oils. Extracted from the seeds of the jojoba plant, this organic oil is perfect for hydrating, balancing, and nourishing your skin and hair. ', 'jojoba-oil-100-pure-organic-cold-pressed-5-l-132086-gallon', 'jojoba oil 100% Pure & Organic cold pressed- 5 L -1.32086 Gallon | Organica', 'Discover the versatility and natural beauty benefits of Jojoba Oil, a lightweight, nutrient-rich oil that mimics the skin''s natural oils. Extracted from the seeds of the jojoba plant, this organic oil is perfect for hydrating, balancing, and nourishing your skin and hair.', 'organic beauty products wholesale, argan oil supplier, moroccan cosmetics, prickly pear oil, argan oil for hair, argan oil for face, pure argan oil, bulk beauty products, natural skincare, private label cosmetics', NULL, NULL, '<h4>100% Pure Organic Jojoba Oil for Hair, Skin,</h4><p><strong>Jojoba oil has many benefits, particularly for dry, very dry, and dehydrated skin. That said, it can also be used on combination and sensitive skin.<br>Jojoba oil has nourishing, protective, rebalancing, and softening properties.<br>Its regenerative properties and the fact that it helps maintain firm skin make it an excellent anti-aging oil. In short, jojoba oil is excellent for all generations! On oily skin and hair, it plays a regulating role in sebum secretions.<br><br>Key Benefits:<br>Hydrates &amp; Moisturizes: Jojoba oil deeply hydrates the skin, leaving it soft, smooth, and supple without feeling greasy.<br><br>Balances Skin: Known for its ability to balance oil production, Jojoba oil is ideal for both dry and oily skin, helping to prevent breakouts while keeping skin hydrated.<br><br>Promotes Healthy Hair: Jojoba oil nourishes the scalp, strengthens hair, and adds shine, making it perfect for dry, damaged, or brittle hair.<br><br>Anti-Aging: Rich in antioxidants and essential fatty acids, Jojoba oil helps fight fine lines, wrinkles, and the signs of aging.<br><br>How to Use:<br>For Skin: Massage a few drops onto the face or body to hydrate and balance your skin.<br><br>For Hair: Apply to the scalp and hair to nourish, promote growth, and add a natural shine.<br><br>For Makeup Removal: Use as a gentle, natural makeup remover, even for sensitive skin around the eyes.<br><br>Embrace the power of Jojoba Oil for a radiant, nourished complexion and healthy, shiny hair. Its gentle, non-comedogenic nature makes it perfect for daily use in your skincare and haircare routine.</strong></p>', 'jojoba oil 100% Pure & Organic cold pressed- 5 L -1.32086 Gallon');
